{
 "name": "application-autoscaling",
 "description": "With Application Auto Scaling, you can configure automatic scaling for the following resources: Amazon AppStream 2.0 fleets Amazon Aurora Replicas Amazon Comprehend document classification and entity recognizer endpoints Amazon DynamoDB tables and global secondary indexes throughput capacity Amazon ECS services Amazon ElastiCache replication groups (Redis OSS and Valkey) and Memcached clusters Amazon EMR clusters Amazon Keyspaces (for Apache Cassandra) tables Lambda function provisioned concurrency Amazon Managed Streaming for Apache Kafka broker storage Amazon Neptune clusters Amazon SageMaker endpoint variants Amazon SageMaker inference components Amazon SageMaker serverless endpoint provisioned concurrency Spot Fleets (Amazon EC2) Pool of WorkSpaces Custom resources provided by your own applications or services To learn more about Application Auto Scaling, see the Application Auto Scaling User Guide.",
